1
00:00:00,672 --> 00:00:03,302
(Leonard:)What do we do?
Should we call someone?

2
00:00:03,308 --> 00:00:06,478
(Howard:)And tell them that we
compromised all the equipment?

3
00:00:06,478 --> 00:00:08,678
(Howard:)Let's just get it out of
here before anyone knows.

4
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,350
(Leonard:)Okay, how do we catch it?

5
00:00:10,348 --> 00:00:12,418
(Howard:)Well, what if we turn
off all the lights

6
00:00:12,417 --> 00:00:14,617
(Howard:)except for one, and
it'll come to it.

7
00:00:14,619 --> 00:00:17,489
It's not a moth!

8
00:00:17,489 --> 00:00:20,119
(Howard:)Don't yell at me.

9
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:22,255
(Howard:)You're not gonna get
any good ideas out of me

10
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,460
(Howard:)if you're yelling.

11
00:00:23,461 --> 00:00:25,031
(Leonard:)Okay, so if I remain calm,

12
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:28,030
(Leonard:)I'll get more gems like,
"Turn off the lights"?!

13
00:00:28,033 --> 00:00:29,503
(Howard:)Great, we're turning
on each other.

14
00:00:29,501 --> 00:00:31,501
(Howard:)That's just what the
bird wants us to do!

15
00:00:34,239 --> 00:00:37,509
(Penny:)So, Dr. Koothrappali,
long flight?

16
00:00:37,509 --> 00:00:39,639
20 hours.
Oh, that's rough.

17
00:00:39,644 --> 00:00:42,684
(Dr Koothrappali:)Not at all. Did you know that
when you fly transcontinental

18
00:00:42,681 --> 00:00:46,111
(Dr Koothrappali:)without your wife, you don't
pray for the plane to crash?

19
00:00:48,486 --> 00:00:50,786
Can you please talk
about anything else?

20
00:00:50,789 --> 00:00:53,289
(Dr Koothrappali:)Forgive me.

21
00:00:53,291 --> 00:00:54,261
(Dr Koothrappali:)How are you
and Leonard?

22
00:00:54,259 --> 00:00:56,359
(Penny:)Oh, great.
Everything's good.

23
00:00:56,361 --> 00:00:58,631
(Dr Koothrappali:)I see you got engaged.
Yes, we did.

24
00:00:58,630 --> 00:00:59,700
(Dr Koothrappali:)Let me tell you a story.

